msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” uutta osoitetta ei lähetetty: sen painotalo, %2$s, "
"ei ota vastaan osoitemuutoksia Pixonautin kautta. Tuote toimitetaan aiempaan "
"osoitteeseen; ota yhteyttä painotaloon."

#. translators: Fallback for a printshop name that is not known, inside an order note: "its printshop, the printshop, takes no address changes". Lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:762
msgid "the printshop"
msgstr "painotalo"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:766
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%s\" was not sent: its printshop needs a "
"postcode. Add one and update the order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” uutta osoitetta ei lähetetty: sen painotalo "
"tarvitsee postinumeron. Lisää postinumero ja päivitä tilaus."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:771
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%1$s\" was not sent: Pixonaut answered "
"\"%2$s\". It ships to the address it had."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” uutta osoitetta ei lähetetty: Pixonaut vastasi "
"”%2$s”. Tuote toimitetaan aiempaan osoitteeseen."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:156
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was deleted in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” suunnitelma poistettiin Pixonautissa."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:161 src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:253
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was deleted in Pixonaut, so the item cannot "
"be printed. Check the order with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” suunnitelma poistettiin Pixonautissa, joten tuotetta "
"ei voi painaa. Tarkista tilaus asiakkaan kanssa."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:193
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was changed in Pixonaut. The changed design "
"goes to approval again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” suunnitelmaa muutettiin Pixonautissa. Muutettu "
"suunnitelma menee uudelleen hyväksyttäväksi."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:198 src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:805
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was changed in Pixonaut after it was "
"approved, so it was not sent to the printshop. Check the design before it is "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” suunnitelmaa muutettiin Pixonautissa sen "
"hyväksymisen jälkeen, joten sitä ei lähetetty painotaloon. Tarkista "
"suunnitelma ennen kuin se painetaan."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:205
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was changed in Pixonaut after it was "
"ordered. The printshop order is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” suunnitelmaa muutettiin Pixonautissa tilaamisen "
"jälkeen. Painotilaus on ennallaan."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/DesignChanged.php:208
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the design for \"%s\" was changed in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” suunnitelmaa muutettiin Pixonautissa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:115
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. A plugin or the theme holds "
"it back (pixonaut_wc_fulfilment_can_fulfil)."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Lisäosa tai teema pidättää "
"sen (pixonaut_wc_fulfilment_can_fulfil)."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:124
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. It was ordered under another "
"Pixonaut workspace than the one the store is connected to now."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Se tilattiin eri Pixonaut-"
"työtilassa kuin siinä, johon kauppa on nyt yhdistetty."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:199
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. An earlier attempt sent its "
"printshop order under the cart's reference, so the store cannot tell whether "
"it was placed. Check the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Aiempi yritys lähetti sen "
"painotilauksen ostoskorin viitteellä, joten kauppa ei voi tietää, tehtiinkö "
"tilaus. Tarkista tilaus Pixonautissa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:217
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. The line has no design for "
"one of its sides."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Tilausriviltä puuttuu "
"suunnitelma yhdeltä sen puolista."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:270
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. The line does not record how "
"the customer approved the design."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Tilausrivistä ei käy ilmi, "
"miten asiakas hyväksyi suunnitelman."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: Pixonaut order id.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:759
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: a Pixonaut automation already ordered \"%1$s\", as order %2$s. The "
"store took that order on instead of placing another."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: Pixonaut-automaatio tilasi jo tuotteen ”%1$s” tilauksena %2$s. "
"Kauppa otti kyseisen tilauksen hoitoonsa uuden tilauksen tekemisen sijaan."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the reason Pixonaut gave.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:834
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" failed when it was placed: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilaus epäonnistui, kun se tehtiin: %2$s"

#. translators: Fills in %2$s of an order note when the printshop order failed without a reason. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:837 src/Fulfilment/OrderFailed.php:84
msgid "no reason given."
msgstr "syytä ei annettu."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the order status Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:852
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" was placed with the status "
"\"%2$s\", which the store cannot go on from. Check the order with the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilaus tehtiin tilassa ”%2$s”, josta kauppa "
"ei voi jatkaa. Tarkista tilaus painotalon kanssa."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: number of attempts, 3: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:272
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop after %2$d attempts. "
"Pixonaut last answered \"%3$s\". Check the order in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%1$s” ei lähetetty painotaloon %2$d yrityksen jälkeen. "
"Pixonaut vastasi viimeksi ”%3$s”. Tarkista tilaus Pixonautissa ja yritä "
"sitten uudelleen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:370
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop. Pixonaut answered "
"\"%2$s\", and the store could not schedule another attempt. Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%1$s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Pixonaut vastasi ”%2$s”, "
"eikä kauppa voinut ajastaa uutta yritystä. Yritä tuotteen lähettämistä "
"uudelleen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:400
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. The Pixonaut sandbox no longer knows its "
"design, print or order (\"%2$s\"); this happens when the sandbox's data was "
"reset. Place the item again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” vaatii toimia. Pixonautin sandbox ei enää tunne sen "
"suunnitelmaa, painotiedostoa tai tilausta (”%2$s”); näin käy, kun sandboxin "
"tiedot on nollattu. Tilaa tuote uudelleen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: the Pixonaut order the design already has, 4: what the merchant can do.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:409
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. Pixonaut refused it with \"%2$s\": its "
"design already has the Pixonaut order %3$s. %4$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” vaatii toimia. Pixonaut hylkäsi sen koodilla ”%2$s”: "
"sen suunnitelmalla on jo Pixonaut-tilaus %3$s. %4$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: what the merchant can do.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:418
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. Pixonaut refused it with \"%2$s\". %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” vaatii toimia. Pixonaut hylkäsi sen koodilla ”%2$s”. "
"%3$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the order's status in Pixonaut.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:194
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" is now \"%2$s\" in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilauksen tila Pixonautissa on nyt ”%2$s”."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:484
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" could not be sent again: the store could not schedule it. "
"Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei voitu lähettää uudelleen: kauppa ei voinut "
"ajastaa sitä. Yritä tuotteen lähettämistä uudelleen."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:494
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" will be sent to the printshop again."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuote ”%s” lähetetään painotaloon uudelleen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the new Pixonaut order id.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:597
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was sent to the printshop again, as order %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” lähetettiin painotaloon uudelleen tilauksena %2$s."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the new Pixonaut order id, 3: its status.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:609
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was sent to the printshop again, as order %2$s, which is "
"\"%3$s\"."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” lähetettiin painotaloon uudelleen tilauksena %2$s, "
"jonka tila on ”%3$s”."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: what the merchant learned from the printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:640
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop has the order for \"%1$s\". %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: painotalolla on tuotteen ”%1$s” tilaus. %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: what the merchant learned from the printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:669
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop does not have the order for \"%1$s\". %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: painotalolla ei ole tuotteen ”%1$s” tilausta. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:695 src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:405
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderCancelled.php:78
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was cancelled."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus peruttiin."

#. translators: Reason in an order note when a merchant rehearses a failed printshop order in the Pixonaut sandbox.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:716
msgid "Rehearsed in the Pixonaut sandbox."
msgstr "Harjoiteltu Pixonautin sandboxissa."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why Pixonaut refused, a full sentence or two.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:804
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop again. %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%1$s” ei lähetetty painotaloon uudelleen. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" is not cancelled yet: the store could not schedule it. It "
"is not sent to the printshop meanwhile. Update the order to try again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei ole vielä peruttu: kauppa ei voinut ajastaa sitä. "
"Sitä ei sillä välin lähetetä painotaloon. Yritä uudelleen päivittämällä "
"tilaus."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:265
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: a design of \"%1$s\" could not be rejected in Pixonaut, which "
"answered \"%2$s\". It stays unapproved there, so it is not printed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” suunnitelmaa ei voitu hylätä Pixonautissa, joka "
"vastasi ”%2$s”. Suunnitelma jää siellä hyväksymättömäksi, joten sitä ei "
"paineta."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was cancelled before it was sent to the printshop."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuote ”%s” peruttiin ennen kuin se lähetettiin painotaloon."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:294
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" may have a printshop order, which was not cancelled: the "
"store is not connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Check "
"the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteella ”%s” voi olla painotilaus, jota ei peruttu: kauppaa ei "
"ole yhdistetty siihen Pixonaut-työtilaan, jossa se tilattiin. Tarkista "
"tilaus Pixonautissa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:387
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was not cancelled: the store is not "
"connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Cancel it in "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilausta ei peruttu: kauppaa ei ole yhdistetty "
"siihen Pixonaut-työtilaan, jossa se tilattiin. Peru se Pixonautissa."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why the printshop keeps the order.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:422
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" was not cancelled: %2$s Ask the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilausta ei peruttu: %2$s Ota yhteyttä "
"painotaloon."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:432
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was cancelled. Its printshop order had failed, so there was "
"nothing to stop at the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%s” peruttiin. Sen painotilaus oli epäonnistunut, joten "
"painotalossa ei ollut mitään pysäytettävää."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: Pixonaut's reason, if it gave one, with a leading space.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" could not be cancelled: Pixonaut "
"answered \"%2$s\".%3$s Ask the printshop to stop it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilausta ei voitu perua: Pixonaut vastasi "
"”%2$s”.%3$s Pyydä painotaloa pysäyttämään se."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:561
msgid "the printshop has made it already."
msgstr "painotalo on jo valmistanut sen."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:563
msgid "the printshop has begun it and did not cancel it."
msgstr "painotalo on aloittanut sen eikä perunut sitä."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:565
msgid "its printshop cannot stop orders through Pixonaut."
msgstr "sen painotalo ei voi pysäyttää tilauksia Pixonautin kautta."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:567
msgid "its printshop is no longer connected to Pixonaut."
msgstr "sen painotaloa ei ole enää yhdistetty Pixonautiin."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:569
msgid "the printshop cancelled it, but it shipped meanwhile."
msgstr "painotalo perui sen, mutta se ehdittiin sillä välin lähettää."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:571
msgid "the printshop has it."
msgstr "se on painotalolla."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:115
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused the printshop the item was sent to: only the printshop of "
"the product's blank can make it. Check the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut hylkäsi painotalon, jolle tuote lähetettiin: vain tuotteen "
"pohjatuotteen painotalo voi valmistaa sen. Tarkista pohjatuote Pixonautissa "
"ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:116
msgid ""
"The printshop that makes the item is disconnected in Pixonaut. Reconnect it "
"in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen valmistavan painotalon yhteys on katkaistu Pixonautissa. Yhdistä se "
"uudelleen Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:117
msgid ""
"Pixonaut has no printshop to make the item: its design is on no blank, and "
"the workspace has no default printshop. Set one in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonautilla ei ole painotaloa tuotteen valmistamiseen: sen suunnitelma ei "
"ole millään pohjatuotteella, eikä työtilalla ole oletuspainotaloa. Aseta "
"sellainen Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:118
msgid ""
"The blank variant the item was bought as is retired in Pixonaut, so the "
"printshop cannot make it. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pohjatuotteen versio, jona tuote ostettiin, on poistettu käytöstä "
"Pixonautissa, joten painotalo ei voi valmistaa sitä. Hyvitä tai peru tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:120
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not tell which variant of the blank the item is: the product "
"sells no variant of its blank. Pick its variant on the product, then refund "
"or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ei voinut päätellä, mikä pohjatuotteen versio tuote on: tuotteelle "
"ei ole valittu yhtään sen pohjatuotteen versiota. Valitse versio tuotteen "
"asetuksista ja hyvitä tai peru sitten tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:122
msgid ""
"The item's print is at a size its position on the blank does not print, or "
"larger than the printshop's machine takes. Check the blank's positions and "
"the printshop's machine in Pixonaut, then have the customer personalise the "
"item again at a size it prints."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen painatus on kokoa, jota sen painokohta pohjatuotteessa ei paina, "
"tai suurempi kuin painotalon kone ottaa. Tarkista pohjatuotteen painokohdat "
"ja painotalon kone Pixonautissa ja pyydä sitten asiakasta personoimaan tuote "
"uudelleen koossa, joka voidaan painaa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:123
msgid ""
"The printshop's embroidery machine cannot stitch the item's design as it is, "
"for example a photo or a picture of too many colours. Check the design in "
"Pixonaut, then have the customer personalise the item again."
msgstr ""
"Painotalon kirjontakone ei pysty kirjomaan tuotteen suunnitelmaa "
"sellaisenaan, esimerkiksi valokuvaa tai kuvaa, jossa on liian monta väriä. "
"Tarkista suunnitelma Pixonautissa ja pyydä sitten asiakasta personoimaan "
"tuote uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:124
msgid ""
"The printshop's embroidery machine could not read the item's design. Check "
"the design in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalon kirjontakone ei pystynyt lukemaan tuotteen suunnitelmaa. Tarkista "
"suunnitelma Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:125
msgid ""
"The printshop charges a fee to set up the embroidery, and the fee has not "
"been accepted in Pixonaut. Accept it for the printshop in Pixonaut, then "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalo perii maksun kirjonnan valmistelusta, eikä maksua ole hyväksytty "
"Pixonautissa. Hyväksy painotalon maksu Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten "
"uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:126
msgid ""
"The printshop needs a value the blank's variant or placement does not have. "
"Fill it in for the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalo tarvitsee arvon, jota pohjatuotteen versiolla tai painokohdalla ei "
"ole. Täytä se pohjatuotteelle Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:127
msgid ""
"The design already has a printshop order in Pixonaut that this item did not "
"place, for example one placed in the studio. Check that order; if the item "
"is to be made as well, choose Order again anyway."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelmalla on jo Pixonautissa painotilaus, jota tämä tuote ei tehnyt, "
"esimerkiksi studiossa tehty. Tarkista kyseinen tilaus; jos myös tämä tuote "
"valmistetaan, valitse Tilaa silti uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:128
msgid ""
"The design's personal data was erased in Pixonaut, so it can no longer be "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelman henkilötiedot poistettiin Pixonautissa, joten sitä ei voi enää "
"painaa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:130
msgid "The design changed in Pixonaut since the customer approved it."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelma on muuttunut Pixonautissa sen jälkeen, kun asiakas hyväksyi sen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:131
msgid ""
"The design was deleted in Pixonaut, so it can no longer be printed. Check "
"the order with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelma poistettiin Pixonautissa, joten sitä ei voi enää painaa. "
"Tarkista tilaus asiakkaan kanssa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:132
msgid ""
"The design was changed in Pixonaut after it was approved, so it was not sent "
"to the printshop. Check the design before it is printed."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelmaa muutettiin Pixonautissa sen hyväksymisen jälkeen, joten sitä ei "
"lähetetty painotaloon. Tarkista suunnitelma ennen kuin se painetaan."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:133
msgid "Pixonaut no longer accepts the store's key. Reconnect the store."
msgstr "Pixonaut ei enää hyväksy kaupan avainta. Yhdistä kauppa uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:134
msgid ""
"The design was changed in Pixonaut after the customer bought it, so their "
"proof no longer shows it. Check the design with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelmaa muutettiin Pixonautissa sen jälkeen, kun asiakas osti sen, "
"joten asiakkaan vedos ei enää näytä sitä. Tarkista suunnitelma asiakkaan "
"kanssa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:135
msgid ""
"The design was no longer waiting for the customer's approval when the order "
"was paid, for example because it was rejected in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelma ei enää odottanut asiakkaan hyväksyntää, kun tilaus maksettiin, "
"esimerkiksi koska se oli hylätty Pixonautissa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:136
msgid ""
"The customer did not approve the design by the deadline, so it was rejected "
"and will not be printed. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Asiakas ei hyväksynyt suunnitelmaa määräaikaan mennessä, joten se hylättiin "
"eikä sitä paineta. Hyvitä tai peru tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:137
msgid ""
"The customer rejected the proof of the design, so it will not be printed. "
"Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Asiakas hylkäsi suunnitelman vedoksen, joten sitä ei paineta. Hyvitä tai "
"peru tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:139
msgid "Pixonaut could not be reached, or kept failing. Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonautiin ei saatu yhteyttä, tai se epäonnistui toistuvasti. Yritä "
"tuotteen lähettämistä uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:140
msgid "The printshop order failed. Retry it, or cancel the item."
msgstr "Painotilaus epäonnistui. Yritä uudelleen tai peru tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:141
msgid ""
"Pixonaut cannot tell whether the printshop received the order. Check with "
"the printshop, then tell Pixonaut whether it has the order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ei voi tietää, saiko painotalo tilauksen. Tarkista asia "
"painotalolta ja kerro sitten Pixonautille, onko tilaus painotalolla."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:142
msgid "Check the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Tarkista tilaus Pixonautissa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:154
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was sent, but its answer was lost, "
"so Pixonaut cannot tell whether the printshop has it. Check with the "
"printshop, then settle it in the Pixonaut box of this order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus lähetettiin, mutta sen vastaus katosi, "
"joten Pixonaut ei voi tietää, onko tilaus painotalolla. Tarkista asia "
"painotalolta ja ratkaise se sitten tämän tilauksen Pixonaut-ruudussa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderDeliveryChanged.php:121
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the delivery address of the printshop order for \"%s\" was changed "
"in Pixonaut. The address of this order was not changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilauksen toimitusosoitetta muutettiin "
"Pixonautissa. Tämän tilauksen osoitetta ei muutettu."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the reason Pixonaut gave.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderFailed.php:81
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilaus epäonnistui: %2$s"

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:138
msgid ""
"Pixonaut has taken the order and holds it. It has not been sent to the "
"printshop yet."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut on ottanut tilauksen vastaan ja pysäyttänyt sen. Sitä ei ole vielä "
"lähetetty painotaloon."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:153
msgid "It has not been sent to the printshop yet."
msgstr "Sitä ei ole vielä lähetetty painotaloon."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why it is held and when it goes ahead.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:155
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" is held. %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilaus on pysäytetty. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:170
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because the Pixonaut "
"workspace upgraded its plan."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus vapautettiin, koska Pixonaut-työtila "
"päivitti pakettinsa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:172
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because a new month "
"began on the free plan."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus vapautettiin, koska ilmaisen paketin "
"uusi kuukausi alkoi."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:174
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus vapautettiin."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:179
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because the Pixonaut "
"workspace upgraded its plan, and goes on to the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus vapautettiin, koska Pixonaut-työtila "
"päivitti pakettinsa, ja se etenee painotaloon."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:181
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because a new month "
"began on the free plan, and goes on to the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus vapautettiin, koska ilmaisen paketin "
"uusi kuukausi alkoi, ja se etenee painotaloon."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:183
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released, and goes on to the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus vapautettiin, ja se etenee painotaloon."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:194
msgid "The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's orders for this month."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-työtila on käyttänyt ilmaisen pakettinsa tämän kuukauden tilaukset."

#. translators: %d: the free plan's orders a month.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:197
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's %d order for this month."
msgid_plural ""
"The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's %d orders for this month."
msgstr[0] ""
"Pixonaut-työtila on käyttänyt ilmaisen pakettinsa %d tilauksen tältä "
"kuukaudelta."
msgstr[1] ""
"Pixonaut-työtila on käyttänyt ilmaisen pakettinsa %d tilausta tältä "
"kuukaudelta."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:201
msgid ""
"It goes to the printshop when the workspace upgrades, or when the month "
"resets if the new month has room for it."
msgstr ""
"Se lähtee painotaloon, kun työtila päivittää pakettinsa, tai kun kuukausi "
"vaihtuu, jos se mahtuu uuden kuukauden tilauksiin."

#. translators: %s: the date the month resets.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:204
#, php-format
msgid ""
"It goes to the printshop when the workspace upgrades, or when the month "
"resets on %s if the new month has room for it."
msgstr ""
"Se lähtee painotaloon, kun työtila päivittää pakettinsa, tai kun kuukausi "
"vaihtuu %s, jos se mahtuu uuden kuukauden tilauksiin."

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: status Pixonaut reported
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:195
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut reported the status \"%2$s\" for \"%1$s\", which this plugin "
"version does not know; nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ilmoitti tuotteelle ”%1$s” tilan ”%2$s”, jota tämä lisäosan versio "
"ei tunne; mitään ei muutettu."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:303
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was printed at the printshop."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuote ”%s” painettiin painotalossa."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:333
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was shipped."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuote ”%s” lähetettiin."

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: carrier, tracking number and link
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:336
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was shipped. Tracking: %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” lähetettiin. Seuranta: %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product names, each in quotes. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/ParcelDelivered.php:60
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the parcel with %s was delivered."
msgstr "Pixonaut: paketti, jossa on %s, on toimitettu."

#. translators: %s: product name. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/ParcelShipped.php:236
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: part of \"%s\" was shipped. The rest follow in another parcel."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: osa tuotteesta ”%s” lähetettiin. Loput tulevat toisessa paketissa."

#. translators: 1: copies shipped, 2: copies ordered, 3: product name. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/ParcelShipped.php:238
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: %1$d of %2$d of \"%3$s\" were shipped. The rest follow in another "
"parcel."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteesta ”%3$s” lähetettiin %1$d/%2$d. Loput tulevat toisessa "
"paketissa."

#. translators: 1: what was shipped, an order note, 2: carrier, tracking number and link. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/ParcelShipped.php:241
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s Tracking: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s Seuranta: %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product names, each in quotes, 2: carrier, tracking number and link. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/ParcelTrackingChanged.php:110
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: tracking was added for the parcel with %1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: pakettiin, jossa on %1$s, lisättiin seuranta: %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product names, each in quotes, 2: new carrier, tracking number and link, 3: the carrier and tracking number before. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/ParcelTrackingChanged.php:112
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the tracking of the parcel with %1$s was corrected to %2$s. It was "
"%3$s."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: paketin, jossa on %1$s, seuranta korjattiin: nyt %2$s, aiemmin "
"%3$s."

#. translators: %s: the error code Pixonaut answered, e.g. order_at_printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:30
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused to place the order again with \"%s\". Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kieltäytyi tekemästä tilausta uudelleen koodilla ”%s”. Mitään ei "
"muutettu."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:42
msgid "The print is still being made. Try again once it is finished."
msgstr "Painatusta valmistellaan vielä. Yritä uudelleen, kun se on valmis."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:43
msgid ""
"The printshop order is no longer failed in Pixonaut, so it was not placed "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Painotilaus ei ole enää epäonnistunut Pixonautissa, joten sitä ei tehty "
"uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:44
msgid "The printshop has the order already, so it is not placed again."
msgstr "Tilaus on jo painotalolla, joten sitä ei tehdä uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:45
msgid ""
"Pixonaut places the item again only once it failed without reaching the "
"printshop: the printshop has it already, or it is no longer failed. Check "
"the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut tekee tuotteen uudelleen vain, jos se epäonnistui ennen kuin se "
"päätyi painotalolle: tuote on jo painotalolla, tai se ei ole enää "
"epäonnistunut. Tarkista tilaus Pixonautissa."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:46
msgid "The order was placed again already, by an earlier retry."
msgstr "Tilaus on jo tehty uudelleen aiemmalla yrityksellä."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:47
msgid ""
"The design changed in Pixonaut since its print was made, so the print is no "
"longer the design's. Check the design in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelmaa on muutettu Pixonautissa painatuksen valmistumisen jälkeen, "
"joten painatus ei enää vastaa suunnitelmaa. Tarkista suunnitelma "
"Pixonautissa."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:48
msgid ""
"The print's files were deleted in Pixonaut, so it cannot be sent to the "
"printshop again."
msgstr ""
"Painatuksen tiedostot poistettiin Pixonautissa, joten sitä ei voi lähettää "
"painotaloon uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:49
msgid ""
"The design has another printshop order in Pixonaut that this item did not "
"place, for example one placed in the studio. Check that order in Pixonaut, "
"and cancel it there or settle the item with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelmalla on Pixonautissa toinen painotilaus, jota tämä tuote ei "
"tehnyt, esimerkiksi studiossa tehty. Tarkista kyseinen tilaus Pixonautissa "
"ja peruuta se siellä, tai sovi tuotteesta asiakkaan kanssa."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:50
msgid "The printshop is paused in Pixonaut. Resume it in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalo on keskeytetty Pixonautissa. Ota se uudelleen käyttöön "
"Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:54
msgid ""
"Pixonaut was busy with the order and changed nothing. Try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut käsitteli tilausta eikä muuttanut mitään. Yritä hetken kuluttua "
"uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:58
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer has the printshop order or its print. Check the order in "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonautissa ei enää ole painotilausta tai sen painatusta. Tarkista tilaus "
"Pixonautissa."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:60
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not accept the request the store sent. Check the Pixonaut log "
"under WooCommerce > Status > Logs."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ei hyväksynyt kaupan lähettämää pyyntöä. Tarkista Pixonautin loki "
"kohdassa WooCommerce > Tila > Lokit."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:62
msgid ""
"The store's key may not place orders again in Pixonaut. Check the key in "
"Pixonaut, or reconnect the store."
msgstr ""
"Kaupan avaimella ei saa tehdä tilauksia uudelleen Pixonautissa. Tarkista "
"avain Pixonautissa tai yhdistä kauppa uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:63
msgid "Printshop orders are turned off for the workspace in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Painotilaukset on poistettu käytöstä työtilalta Pixonautissa."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:64
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace is suspended. Check its billing in Pixonaut, then "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-työtila on jäädytetty. Tarkista sen laskutus Pixonautissa ja yritä "
"sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:65
msgid ""
"The workspace's plan in Pixonaut allows no more of this. Check the plan in "
"Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Työtilan paketin raja on täynnä Pixonautissa. Tarkista paketti Pixonautissa "
"ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:67
msgid ""
"The printshop the order went to is no longer available in Pixonaut. Check "
"the printshop in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalo, jolle tilaus lähti, ei ole enää käytettävissä Pixonautissa. "
"Tarkista painotalo Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:74
msgid ""
"The printshop cannot print the item as it is: it does not offer the print's "
"method or colour output, or the print file is too large for it. Check the "
"printshop and the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalo ei voi painaa tuotetta sellaisenaan: se ei tarjoa painatuksen "
"menetelmää tai väritilaa, tai painotiedosto on sille liian suuri. Tarkista "
"painotalo ja pohjatuote Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:83
msgid ""
"The item's prints do not fit the blank's placements in Pixonaut: a placement "
"the blank must print is empty, or prints share or miss one. Check the "
"blank's placements in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen painatukset eivät sovi pohjatuotteen painokohtiin Pixonautissa: "
"painokohta, johon pohjatuotteessa on painettava, on tyhjä, tai painatukset "
"jakavat painokohdan tai jättävät sen pois. Tarkista pohjatuotteen "
"painokohdat Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:88
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused moving the order to another blank. Place it again as it is, "
"or move it in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kieltäytyi siirtämästä tilausta toiseen pohjatuotteeseen. Tee "
"tilaus uudelleen sellaisenaan tai siirrä se Pixonautissa."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:93
msgid ""
"The item's pages do not fit its blank or its printshop in Pixonaut: a page "
"is missing, named twice or out of the blank's range, or the printshop makes "
"no items of pages. Check the item's pages and printshop in Pixonaut, then "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen sivut eivät sovi sen pohjatuotteeseen tai painotaloon Pixonautissa: "
"sivu puuttuu, on kahdesti tai on pohjatuotteen sallitun alueen ulkopuolella, "
"tai painotalo ei valmista sivuista koostuvia tuotteita. Tarkista tuotteen "
"sivut ja painotalo Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:96
msgid ""
"A page or the cover of the item was designed for another page, or for "
"another number of pages, than it is ordered with. Check the item's designs "
"in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen sivu tai kansi on suunniteltu eri sivulle tai eri sivumäärälle kuin "
"millä tuote tilataan. Tarkista tuotteen suunnitelmat Pixonautissa ja yritä "
"sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:97
msgid ""
"The delivery address lacks the postcode the printshop needs. Add it to the "
"order's shipping address, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Toimitusosoitteesta puuttuu painotalon tarvitsema postinumero. Lisää se "
"tilauksen toimitusosoitteeseen ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:98
msgid ""
"The saved address the order ships to is gone in Pixonaut. Check the order's "
"shipping address, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tallennettua osoitetta, johon tilaus toimitetaan, ei enää ole Pixonautissa. "
"Tarkista tilauksen toimitusosoite ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/Shipments.php:88
msgid "Pixonaut: every item has shipped."
msgstr "Pixonaut: kaikki tuotteet on lähetetty."

#: src/Fulfilment/Shipments.php:101
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: All personalised items shipped. The order's other items are yours "
"to ship."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: kaikki personoidut tuotteet on lähetetty. Tilauksen muiden "
"tuotteiden lähettäminen jää kaupalle."

#. translators: Option of a product's Group numbers setting: the designer's form numbers its groups. Admin product page.
#: src/GroupNumbers.php:47
msgctxt "group numbers"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Käytössä"

#. translators: Option of a product's Group numbers setting: the designer's form shows its groups' names with no numbers. Admin product page.
#: src/GroupNumbers.php:49
msgctxt "group numbers"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Ei käytössä"

#: src/Labels.php:353
msgid "Personalisation is unavailable right now. Please try again later."
msgstr "Personointi ei ole juuri nyt käytettävissä. Yritä myöhemmin uudelleen."

#. translators: On the page of a personalised product the shop cannot sell for now, in place of the add-to-cart button.
#: src/Labels.php:358
msgid "This product is not available right now."
msgstr "Tämä tuote ei ole juuri nyt saatavilla."

#: src/Labels.php:362
msgid "Please personalise this product before adding it to your cart."
msgstr "Personoi tämä tuote ennen kuin lisäät sen ostoskoriin."

#: src/Labels.php:366
msgid "We could not save your design. Please try again."
msgstr "Suunnitelmaasi ei voitu tallentaa. Yritä uudelleen."

#: src/Labels.php:370
msgid "Your design does not match this product. Please personalise it again."
msgstr "Suunnitelmasi ei vastaa tätä tuotetta. Personoi se uudelleen."

#: src/Labels.php:374
msgid "This product was just updated, please reload."
msgstr "Tätä tuotetta päivitettiin juuri, lataa sivu uudelleen."

#: src/Labels.php:378
msgid "Your design preview expired. Please approve it again."
msgstr "Suunnitelmasi esikatselu vanhentui. Hyväksy se uudelleen."

#: src/Labels.php:382
msgid ""
"This design is already in a cart or an order. Please personalise the product "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Tämä suunnitelma on jo ostoskorissa tai tilauksessa. Personoi tuote "
"uudelleen."

#: src/Labels.php:386
msgid "Your design could not be prepared. Please check it and try again."
msgstr "Suunnitelmaasi ei voitu valmistella. Tarkista se ja yritä uudelleen."

#. translators: %s: the name of the personalised product in the shopper's cart.
#: src/Labels.php:391
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The design for \"%s\" is no longer available. Please remove it from your "
"cart, or personalise it again."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen ”%s” suunnitelma ei ole enää saatavilla. Poista tuote ostoskorista "
"tai personoi se uudelleen."

#. translators: %s: the names of the product options the shopper has not chosen yet, as a list such as "Colour and Size". Notice on the product page after pressing the Personalise button.
#: src/Labels.php:396
#, php-format
msgid "Please choose a value for %s before personalising this product."
msgstr "Valitse arvo kohteelle %s ennen tämän tuotteen personointia."

#. translators: %s: the labels of the design's fields the shopper must change, as a list such as "Photo, Name and Class".
#: src/Labels.php:401
#, php-format
msgid "Please change these fields: %s"
msgstr "Muuta nämä kentät: %s"

#. translators: Notice on the product page, shown to the shopper, when the design was refused because the product cannot be printed at the chosen print size.
