msgstr "Arvojen nimet painikkeiden vieressä"

#. translators: Help under the "Value names beside swatches" select on the screen that adds or edits a product attribute.
#: templates/admin/swatch-names-field.php:23
msgid ""
"For product options shown as swatches in the designer: whether a value drawn "
