"asetus on Pixonautin asetussivulla. Arvon, jolla ei ole väriä tai kuvaa, "
"nimi näytetään aina."

#. translators: Heading of the pricing rule fields on the screen that adds or edits a value of a product attribute.
#: templates/admin/term-price-rule.php:26
msgid "Pricing rule for this value"
msgstr "Tämän arvon hinnoittelusääntö"

#. translators: Help under the pricing rule fields on the screen that adds or edits a value of a product attribute.
#: templates/admin/term-price-rule.php:28
msgid ""
"Changes the store’s pricing rule for every variation with this value, in "
"every product. An empty field follows the store’s rule, shown in grey. A "
"product or a variation that sets a part itself wins over the value."
